        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions MDS2RDDSBR, Madison Reeded Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Reed Entry Door Handle is perfect for grand doors in both residential and commercial settings. It is big, available in either 24 inches or 30 inch lengths with both having 1-1/2 inch diameters. This Madison Reeded Door Handle combines the traditional beauty of a reed handle with decorative finials and fancy mounting brackets with a beautiful end result. Choose from surface, thru-bolt, or back-to-back mounting.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 2 Pull:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS02-specifications.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions MDS2RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>MDS2024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.98\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>MDS2030RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.98\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—  it can be custom designed to fit your specific door application in lengths up to 6 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Reed Entry Door Handle",
                "description": "The Large Reed Entry Door Handle is perfect for grand doors in both residential and commercial settings. It is big, available in either 24 inches or 30 inch lengths with both having 1-1/2 inch diameters. This Madison Reeded Door Handle combines the traditional beauty of a reed handle with decorative finials and fancy mounting brackets with a beautiful end result. Choose from surface, thru-bolt, or back-to-back mounting.\r\n",
